<![CDATA[<div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting Admission Services at Arizona State University.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission requirements and instructions on how to apply are listed on our <a href="http://www.asu.edu/">website</a>. For help with your next steps, you can connect with your dedicated admission representative at <a href="https://asu.edu/findmyrep">asu.edu/findmyrep</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Please let us know if we can assist with anything else.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thank you,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>